			<h1 style="font-size: 44px; line-height: 48px;"><img style="width: 220px;" src="https://www.k-ruoka.fi/assets/27417/img/logo-kruoka.svg"></h1>	
			<p style="font-weight:400">K-Ruoka is the biggest food media and online grocery store in Finland. It's a home for over 8 000 tested recipes, countless articles and four different brands: K-Supermarket, K-Citymarket, K-Market and Neste K which have over 1 000 stores across Finland. </p>

			<p style="font-weight:400">I joined the team to unify the user experience and support K-Ruoka in the journey to become the very best online grocery store in Finland. I took part in designing both the web service and the native mobile app.
			</p>
			
			<p style="font-weight:400">
				<strong>Role</strong>: Senior Product Designer<br>
				<strong>Time</strong>: 2018 – 2020<br>
				<strong>Awards</strong>: <a href="https://2020.grandone.fi/kilpailutyot/?palkinto=voittajat&kategoria=paras-verkkopalvelu-2002" target="_blank">Grand One 2020 <span id="year"></span> - Best online service</a><br>
				<strong>Tools</strong>:
			</p>
		  

