			<p>We had to integrate all the grocery chains under K-Ruoka.fi, so the main navigation and the site structure had to be revisited. </p>
			
			<p>The former front page didn't really have a proper structure or any personalized content, so we re-designed it to better match the user's needs. We also wanted to empasize what K-Ruoka.fi is about, since we integrated numerous web pages under one umbrella.</p>
