			<h2>New sites for individual grocery stores</h2>
			<p>The old grocery store sites only had the very basic info about the stores. The new design was made in contribution with the merchants, chain managers and validated with customers via <a href="https://maze.co/" target="_blank">Maze</a>.</p>
			
			<p>At the same time I took part in designing the internal tool for the merchants to manage their own sites. The internal tool made it easier to manage opening hours, custom notifications, basic information and menus of the in-store restaurants and café's.</p>
