			<h2>Product listing and add to basket interactions</h2>
			<p>The add to basket function was re-designed so that the user would see which items they would already have in the basket just by noticing the subtle change in the background color. The microinteractions were also tweaked and a delete trash can added for quickly deleting items from your basket.</p>
